# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — header-only 模板对非 include/ 子目录头文件漏复制 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-25
# Software: bitmapplusplus 1.1.1
# Gate: conan-verify G2 后消费者验证（include/ 为空）— R01 pc1-38
# Status: DRAFT — 需人工/AI 审核后 promote 为 E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. 审核 error_excerpt 与实际验证
#   2. 改名为 E0XX.kv 并移动到 knowledge/graph/
#   3. 在 knowledge/graph/index.tsv 添加一行
#   4. 编写 knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-bitmapplusplus-1.1.1-header-only-subdir-header-copy
trigger_tool:           conan|conan-verify|conan-create
phase:                  package|test_package
error_signature:        file not found.*\.hpp|
                         include/.*empty|
                         header-only.*copy.*hpp.*source_folder|
                         copy\(.*\.hpp.*src=source_folder

severity:               2
category:               headers, conan, packaging
match_keywords:         header-only, copy, *.hpp, source_folder, lib/include,
                         subdir, include/ empty, package(), single-header,
                         BitmapPlusPlus, bmp, file not found
title:                  header-only 模板 package() 从源码根复制 *.hpp 对位于
                         非 include/ 子目录（如 lib/include/）的头文件漏复制 →
                         include/ 为空，消费者 include 失败；package() src 应指向
                         实际子目录

root_cause: >
  conanfile-headeronly.py.tmpl 的 package() 用
  copy(self, "*.hpp", src=self.source_folder, dst=include/) 复制头文件，
  假设头文件位于源码根或 include/ 子树；当上游把头文件放在非 include/ 子目录
  （lib/include/、src/include/ 等）时，glob *.hpp 无法命中深层头文件，
  包内 include/ 为空。header-only 库无编译阶段，conan create 静默通过，
  缺陷只在消费者 #include <xxx.hpp> 时以 file not found 暴露。

trigger_condition: >
  header-only 库；上游头文件位于非 include/ 子目录（如 lib/include/）；
  配方用 header-only 模板默认 package() 复制路径。

solution: >
  配方 package() 显式指向实际子目录：
    copy(self, "*.hpp", src=os.path.join(self.source_folder, "lib", "include"),
         dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "include"))
  并保持消费者 include 路径与公开头一致（<BitmapPlusPlus.hpp>），
  导出上游 cmake 目标名（bmp::BitmapPlusPlus）。

verification_cmd: >
  conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing &&
  conan-verify bitmapplusplus 1.1.1   # G2 test_package 消费者编译链接运行通过

rec_priority:               1
rec_approach:               recipe-level
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:                   manual-edit
fallback_priority:          2
fallback_approach:          source-code-patch
